{"id":"n29029-1-7","stage":1,"title":"새롭다 · 新","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29029-1-7-1","ko":"요즘 새로운 취미가 생겼다면서?","zh":"听说你最近有了新爱好？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"새로운","meaning":"新","explanation":"새롭다：新；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"새롭다","audio":"/audio/0dd73a3ec78548995542.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29029","senseId":"1","lemma":"새롭다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"취미가","meaning":"爱好，嗜好，趣味，兴趣","explanation":"취미：爱好，嗜好，趣味，兴趣；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"취미","audio":"/audio/fce0e79fcf68c195df88.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72149","senseId":"1","lemma":"취미","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생겼다면서?","meaning":"有，出现","explanation":"생기다：有，出现；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"1","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"0dd73a3ec7854899","term":"새롭다","zh":"新","audio":"/audio/0dd73a3ec78548995542.mp3","entryId":"29029","definition":"与至今为止的东西不同或不曾存在过。","pronunciation":["새롭따"]},{"id":"fce0e79fcf68c195","term":"취미","zh":"爱好，嗜好，趣味，兴趣","audio":"/audio/fce0e79fcf68c195df88.mp3","entryId":"72149","definition":"喜欢而为了乐趣做的事。","pronunciation":["취ː미"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"有，出现","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"新增了原本没有的东西。","pronunciation":["생기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5249a851ee6d2aabaceb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n29029-1-7-2","ko":"우표를 수집하는 것에 재미가 생겼어.","zh":"我开始对集邮感兴趣了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우표를","meaning":"邮票","explanation":"우표：邮票；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"우표","audio":"/audio/18f11c9b5117e408d559.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26680","senseId":"1","lemma":"우표","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수집하는","meaning":"收集，收藏","explanation":"수집하다：收集，收藏；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"수집하다","audio":"/audio/0fda42955dc1bd416d7e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15773","senseId":"1","lemma":"수집하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것에","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"재미가","meaning":"兴趣，趣味","explanation":"재미：兴趣，趣味；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"재미","audio":"/audio/1ad5f1ed1dfcf49c8405.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75754","senseId":"1","lemma":"재미","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생겼어.","meaning":"有，出现","explanation":"생기다：有，出现；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"1","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"18f11c9b5117e408","term":"우표","zh":"邮票","audio":"/audio/18f11c9b5117e408d559.mp3","entryId":"26680","definition":"作为缴纳邮寄费用的证明，贴在邮件上的小贴纸。","pronunciation":["우표"]},{"id":"0fda42955dc1bd41","term":"수집하다","zh":"收集，收藏","audio":"/audio/0fda42955dc1bd416d7e.mp3","entryId":"15773","definition":"为了兴趣或研究而寻找聚集物品或资料等。","pronunciation":["수지파다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"1ad5f1ed1dfcf49c","term":"재미","zh":"兴趣，趣味","audio":"/audio/1ad5f1ed1dfcf49c8405.mp3","entryId":"75754","de